        },
        {
            "id": "44c2f83c-0f01-4892-8bef-a420936a4867",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "A",
            "positionX": 4540.66650390625,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2eaa9554-ed28-4983-85ee-e36b153ad33e",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "不好意思，请问您之前提到的大会是指什么呢？",
            "positionX": 4540.66650390625,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "03a08ebb-ba38-46ff-855a-3d7cd0a64754",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "别客气，小姑娘你不是芸台本地人吧？\r\n",
            "positionX": 4540.66650390625,
            "positionY": 1112.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9017c962-ac14-4892-9c3e-538bd56704c8",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "（获得事件条目：芸台市内的可疑团体）",
            "positionX": 7996.66650390625,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "98dbd1c3-f1dc-461e-8546-a3b22b57573d",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "（获得事件条目：乞巧大会）",
            "positionX": 8333.333984375,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0df8024f-669c-4680-ba93-aa00b27a9f01",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "哎呀，你们这个年纪的孩子果然会对这种神秘的团体感兴趣呢~\r\n",
            "positionX": 4906.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "44cc4260-e22a-452c-b56b-aba37f3b6505",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "呵呵呵~阿姨我大学的时候也很喜欢研究这种事，还加入了研究本地民俗的社团，拜此所赐遇见了这孩子的父亲，很青春吧？",
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f97cba86-77b1-4bd3-a5d5-8cc7fbd14b68",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "......（脸红）。",
            "positionX": 5680.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e9820597-868d-4bad-b788-9c961a85adba",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "哈哈哈哈妈妈又把爸爸说脸红了！\r\n",
            "positionX": 6042.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b724b8a5-9dd1-4cc1-bef3-549fd2949676",
            "index": 21,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "（真是个有活力的家庭啊。）\r\n",
            "positionX": 6444.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5f76f23e-bf86-4296-bb56-543c1dcde82d",
            "index": 22,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "不过我确实不是很了解这个戏团的事。虽然经常能见到他们的成员在路边发放周边和进行宣讲活动，但是我见过的所有成员都带着面具，穿着带有兜帽的长袍。\r\n",
            "positionX": 6820.66650390625,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "ea70856c-866b-4cf5-8a56-f568728b5e65",
            "index": 23,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "那些人看起来实在太可疑了，要不是他们的宣传单写着要在今年乞巧大会上表演，我都担心是有什么奇怪的异教团体混进了芸台。\r\n",
            "positionX": 7216.0,
            "positionY": 393.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "32eeb0a5-1562-4a06-9f87-73c14a16c9da",
            "index": 24,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "你不知道吗？芸台每两年一届的乞巧大会啊！那可是芸台特有的，城市级别的盛会。大会上有各种各样有趣的活动，还会有很多本地特色的表演节目哦！\r",
            "positionX": 4932.66650390625,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "888cb919-4346-47f1-a31f-dcdb03f55726",
            "index": 25,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "真的特别好玩！我们今天回去，正好能赶上明天大会正式开幕呢！",
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fda8e819-fa1f-4e87-968a-bdfeaef6f61b",
            "index": 26,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "嗯，我们这班飞机好像预计是晚上八点落地吧，还有一个多小时。",
            "positionX": 5680.0,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "87470ae2-27fc-4efd-bb8e-c1c12a88d50f",
            "index": 27,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "（乞巧？我记得好像是和星象相关的节日？我们那里没有过这个节的习惯。）\r\n",
            "positionX": 6042.0,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f5430c64-1bf8-489c-92f5-58669836ae91",
            "index": 28,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "乞巧节我似乎有印象，芸台是有拜双星的传统吗？",
            "positionX": 6444.0,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "702a9086-23cb-4748-9ec9-a8bd92b04ec2",
            "index": 29,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "?",
            "positionX": 6820.66650390625,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "02a131c3-27c7-4640-a6b7-967b2bf90aeb",
            "index": 30,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "啊，芸台现在的乞巧大会已经没有拜星环节啦~不过拜喜母的人似乎还是有很多的。大会也保留着斗巧的传统，这也是为什么像极乐戏团这种不知来路的奇怪团体也能参与大会进行表演。\r\n",
            "positionX": 7216.0,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "60fdcb60-2edb-462f-b15c-3f1380831fe7",
            "index": 31,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "不过历年来参与斗巧的外地团体其实很少，一般不会起什么事端。",
            "positionX": 7609.3330078125,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8c50eeb8-f34e-4405-9fd3-f2707016a461",
            "index": 32,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "喜母？斗巧？虽然很想再了解一些内容，但已经打扰他们太久了，就先到这里吧。）\r\n\r",
            "positionX": 7996.66650390625,
            "positionY": 742.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "71013a6b-1785-4c5a-ac34-32742c7ec746",
            "index": 33,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "不过要真是这样，本地的官方机关肯定会介入的。",
            "positionX": 7609.3330078125,
            "positionY": 392.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9897c0a9-3125-4905-a90f-680ae0c03e51",
            "index": 34,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "是的阿姨，我是受朋友邀请而来的，事先都不知道有乞巧大会的事。\r\n",
            "positionX": 4932.66650390625,
            "positionY": 1112.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b73e8965-0d73-4282-be53-d49d8195c098",
            "index": 35,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "哎呀，这样正好赶上才叫幸运呢！在芸台玩的开心哦！不过每次大会即将召开之际，芸台都会暂时封城直到三日后大会结束，这点你的朋友有告诉过你吗？\r\n",
            "positionX": 5302.0,
            "positionY": 1112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d7b8d099-0365-49d4-9c94-be6796c03037",
            "index": 36,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "?",
            "positionX": 5680.0,
            "positionY": 1112.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "087aa2a6-2844-41a5-aca8-f1483c82c166",
            "index": 37,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "没有吗，那记得平常都跟朋友呆在一起。往届乞巧大会期间，市内偶尔会爆发骚乱，感觉局势近几年有些紧张，一定要注意安全哦。\r\n",
            "positionX": 6042.0,
            "positionY": 1112.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fc57413e-7bc8-4007-aa76-5b3ca6ed9740",
            "index": 38,
            "characterId": "",
            "content": "Ty",
            "positionX": 6444.0,
            "positionY": 1112.6666259765625,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "061d738a-25a5-44bb-9473-8b1b8aabf6fb",
            "index": 39,
